{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851800/extras/5b23af2dc9a3eae7ce4e63822baaa89d.poster.avif?t=1755136846\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851800/extras/5b23af2dc9a3eae7ce4e63822baaa89d.webm?t=1755136846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851800/extras/5b23af2dc9a3eae7ce4e63822baaa89d.mp4?t=1755136846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play as a happy little parasite living the modern corporate dream: Trying to survive another day in the office. Swing and chomp your way through the vast headquarters of The Coffee Corp, a corporate monument to biological sciences gone awry.<br><br>The Coffee Corp made you, but your instinct set you free.<br><br>Wreak havoc through offices, labs, warehouses and forgotten catacombs and processing units in a physics-based reverse horror experience. Discover new biological abilities, and uncover the depravity of your creators as you make your way deeper in to the facility - driven by instinct and a thirst for fresh blood.<br><br><u><strong>EXPLORE</strong></u><br>Evade capture and explore a hostile world filled with unsuspecting victims and dark secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851800/extras/4e3682d3017fd6949912dc47f991e768.poster.avif?t=1755136846\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851800/extras/4e3682d3017fd6949912dc47f991e768.webm?t=1755136846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851800/extras/4e3682d3017fd6949912dc47f991e768.mp4?t=1755136846\" type=\"v